Language English
Debug Off

Book Startup Ordered No Keep Looped
	Triggered By @EventStart
	
	Page Start No Text
		testing = true
		
		
	End Page Start

	Page ShowEverything No Text
		Visible If testing
		
		Show TileLounge
	
	End Page ShowEverything

	Page Begin
		Visible If Not testing
		
		Text """
			You aren't exactly sure what is happening. Where you are. Who you
			are. Lights move like the aurora borealis, but your eyes are
			closed.
			
			You start to open your eyes but the light burns and you quickly
			close them again. <i>Where am I?</i> you ask yourself. You open your
			eyes just a sliver and can see what feels like blinding light.
			
			After a moment, you find your eyes adjusting to the light. In an
			act of courage, you decide to open your eyes fully...
		"""
	End Page Begin
	
	Page PlaceLounge
		Visible If Not testing
		
		Text """
			You open your but go back to a squint as the bright light sears
			your eyes. Slowly they adjust to the light and, in a moment, you
			realize it was relative:  there is not really that much light.
			
			As your vision settles, the room you are in starts to come into
			focus. Place the {c:TileLounge} tile as shown.
		"""
	End Page PlaceLounge
	
	Page PlaceInvestigators
		Visible If Not testing
		
		Add TokenInvestigatorsUpperLeft, TokenInvestigatorsLowerRight
		
		Text """
			As your awareness improves, you can tell you are on a sofa. Finally,
			you look around and see other people unconscious around you. Divide
			your investigator figures between the locations indicated. Nothing
			and no one seems familiar.
			
			<i>Where am I?</i> you ask yourself again. Someone across the room
			lifts their head to look at you and you realize you asked that out
			loud.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenInvestigatorsUpperLeft, TokenInvestigatorsLowerRight

	End Page PlaceInvestigators
End Book Startup